    "headline": "EPAM cuts annual revenue forecast on weak software services demand",
    "summary": "EPAM Systems on Thursday cut its annual revenue forecast, indicating a slowing demand for its ‌software services and sending its shares down 11% ‌in premarket trading. The company provides a wide range of IT services including ​consulting, cloud and AI transformation and software engineering. Here are some details: • EPAM saw mixed demand across its businesses, with weakness in the vertical serving software and technology clients partly offset by ‌continued strength in financial ⁠services.",
